{"id":"11de8465f2282555","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-boolop.md","title":"Pointwise Boolean operations","display":"df-boolop — Pointwise Boolean operations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-boolop","aliases":["27-df-boolop"],"display":"df-boolop — Pointwise Boolean operations","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.2 Definition 1.3; §1.4; §1.12.1","source_printed_pages":"8–9, 15, 44","source_pdf_pages":"32–33, 39, 68","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-boolop"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-boolop</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolop — Pointwise Boolean operations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.2 Definition 1.3; §1.4; §1.12.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"8–9, 15, 44"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"32–33, 39, 68"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb B\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(z\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为有限指标集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(h_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((h_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 中的族。见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge b\\coloneqq ab,\\quad a\\vee b\\coloneqq a+b-ab,\\quad \\neg a\\coloneqq1-a,\\quad a\\oplus b\\coloneqq(a+b)\\bmod2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge b\\coloneqq ab,\\quad a\\vee b\\coloneqq a+b-ab,\\quad \\neg a\\coloneqq1-a,\\quad a\\oplus b\\coloneqq(a+b)\\bmod2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\circ y\\coloneqq(x_i\\circ y_i)_{i\\in[n]}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\oplus\\}),\\qquad\\neg x\\coloneqq(1-x_i)_{i\\in[n]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\circ y\\coloneqq(x_i\\circ y_i)_{i\\in[n]}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\oplus\\}),\\qquad\\neg x\\coloneqq(1-x_i)_{i\\in[n]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(f\\circ g)(z)\\coloneqq f(z)\\circ g(z)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\oplus\\}),\\qquad(\\neg f)(z)\\coloneqq1-f(z).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(f\\circ g)(z)\\coloneqq f(z)\\circ g(z)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\oplus\\}),\\qquad(\\neg f)(z)\\coloneqq1-f(z).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}h_i\\right)(z)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in I}h_i(z),\\qquad\\left(\\bigvee_{i\\in I}h_i\\right)(z)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{i\\in I}(1-h_i(z)),\\qquad\\prod_{i\\in\\emptyset}h_i(z)\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}h_i\\right)(z)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in I}h_i(z),\\qquad\\left(\\bigvee_{i\\in I}h_i\\right)(z)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{i\\in I}(1-h_i(z)),\\qquad\\prod_{i\\in\\emptyset}h_i(z)\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}b_i\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in I}b_i,\\qquad\\bigvee_{i\\in I}b_i\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{i\\in I}(1-b_i),\\qquad\\bigoplus_{i\\in I}b_i\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{i\\in I}b_i\\right)\\bmod2\\quad((b_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\mathbb B^I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}b_i\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in I}b_i,\\qquad\\bigvee_{i\\in I}b_i\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{i\\in I}(1-b_i),\\qquad\\bigoplus_{i\\in I}b_i\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{i\\in I}b_i\\right)\\bmod2\\quad((b_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\mathbb B^I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{i\\in\\varnothing}b_i=1,\\qquad\\bigvee_{i\\in\\varnothing}b_i=0,\\qquad\\bigoplus_{i\\in\\varnothing}b_i=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigwedge_{i\\in\\varnothing}b_i=1,\\qquad\\bigvee_{i\\in\\varnothing}b_i=0,\\qquad\\bigoplus_{i\\in\\varnothing}b_i=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge A\\coloneqq\\left(\\prod_{x\\in A}x_j\\right)_{j\\in[n]},\\qquad\\bigvee A\\coloneqq\\left(1-\\prod_{x\\in A}(1-x_j)\\right)_{j\\in[n]}\\quad(A\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigwedge A\\coloneqq\\left(\\prod_{x\\in A}x_j\\right)_{j\\in[n]},\\qquad\\bigvee A\\coloneqq\\left(1-\\prod_{x\\in A}(1-x_j)\\right)_{j\\in[n]}\\quad(A\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按论域区分值、向量与函数的运算，补入异或与空族运算。有限向量的合取、析取也逐坐标解释；空合取为全 1 向量，空析取为全 0 向量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$a,b\\in\\mathbb B$，$x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n$，$f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$z\\in\\mathbb B^n$；$I$ 为有限指标集，$(h_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为 $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 中的族。见 [[27-df-boolfunc]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"(h_i)_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\wedge b\\coloneqq ab,\\quad a\\vee b\\coloneqq a+b-ab,\\quad \\neg a\\coloneqq1-a,\\quad a\\oplus b\\coloneqq(a+b)\\bmod2.","display":true},{"tex":"x\\circ y\\coloneqq(x_i\\circ y_i)_{i\\in[n]}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\oplus\\}),\\qquad\\neg x\\coloneqq(1-x_i)_{i\\in[n]}.","display":true},{"tex":"(f\\circ g)(z)\\coloneqq f(z)\\circ g(z)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\oplus\\}),\\qquad(\\neg f)(z)\\coloneqq1-f(z).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}h_i\\right)(z)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in I}h_i(z),\\qquad\\left(\\bigvee_{i\\in I}h_i\\right)(z)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{i\\in I}(1-h_i(z)),\\qquad\\prod_{i\\in\\emptyset}h_i(z)\\coloneqq1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_{i\\in I}b_i\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in I}b_i,\\qquad\\bigvee_{i\\in I}b_i\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{i\\in I}(1-b_i),\\qquad\\bigoplus_{i\\in I}b_i\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{i\\in I}b_i\\right)\\bmod2\\quad((b_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\mathbb B^I).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_{i\\in\\varnothing}b_i=1,\\qquad\\bigvee_{i\\in\\varnothing}b_i=0,\\qquad\\bigoplus_{i\\in\\varnothing}b_i=0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigwedge A\\coloneqq\\left(\\prod_{x\\in A}x_j\\right)_{j\\in[n]},\\qquad\\bigvee A\\coloneqq\\left(1-\\prod_{x\\in A}(1-x_j)\\right)_{j\\in[n]}\\quad(A\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n).","display":true}],"bytes":2177,"backlinks":[{"id":"94b5a40ac9e27f34","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\oplus$ 见 [[27-df-boolop]]，$\\chi_A\\in\\mathbb B^n$ 是下节对 $A\\subseteq[n]$ 构造的特征向量。"},{"id":"227334a8639e2b87","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N^+$，$i\\in[n]$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；降维限制见 [[27-df-restrict]]，异或见 [[27-df-boolop]]。"},{"id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{Lit}_n$ 见 [[27-df-literal]]；常函数与函数运算见 [[27-df-constfunc]]、[[27-df-boolop]]。$\\langle\\cdot\\rangle$ 是单射的有限元组编码；下面 0,…,4 是互异构造标签。表面叶子记号 $0,1,\\ell$ 分别省略 $\\underline0,\\underline1,\\underline\\ell$ 的下划线；连接记号在 Assertion 中给出带标签构造。"},{"id":"825f4a87fb2f99c8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg$ (pointwise operations, see [[27-df-boolop]])"},{"id":"9e9f7b64fb8e6577","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f,g,h\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；布尔域与标量析取见 [[27-df-boolop]]。对 $x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n$，$x\\le y$ 表示 $\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(x_i\\le y_i)$。下式定义布尔函数类 $\\mathrm{BoolPolar}_n$。"},{"id":"187c4495154fb991","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0941fdc1df502e5c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$[n],\\mathbb B$ 见 [[27-df-vardom]]；有限标量合取、析取见 [[27-df-boolop]]。有限序列以函数编码；$\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}$、$\\epsilon$、$\\preceq$、$u^\\frown j$ 由下式定义。$T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}$ 非空有限，且 $\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\;(v\\subseteq u\\Rightarrow v\\in T)$。$V\\subseteq[n]$ 非空；$L_T,I_T,c_T$ 由下式定义，$\\lambda:I_T\\to\\mathbb B$、$\\ell:L_T\\to V$。本节引入谓词 $\\mathrm{Cotree}$；$E_T,\\Gamma_T$ 仅在该谓词成立时定义，$\\Gamma_T$ 的顶点集为 $V$。另引入函数族 $(A_u:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B)_{u\\in T}$。"},{"id":"772edba46cae3b0c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6b55223e341a675a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\bigvee$ 是 [[27-df-boolop]] 中已构造的 $\\mathbb B$ 上有限析取；引入 $\\mathrm{Threshold}^{(k)}_n$。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop|df-boolop — Pointwise Boolean operations]]"},{"id":"2b8b57640647c9bb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,b,c\\in\\mathbb B$；标量运算见 [[27-df-boolop]]。"},{"id":"46e1799ebd356635","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$(T_L,T_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm})$；$\\mathrm{ConsTerm}$ 的部分函数图见 [[27-df-consensus]]。$\\vee$ 是 [[27-df-boolop]] 的逐点布尔析取。"},{"id":"95e854a713c07e6d","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\bigvee$ 的有限布尔标量及空族语义见 [[27-df-boolop]]。"},{"id":"60a077d3620d4c97","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f\\land g$, $f\\lor g$ are pointwise operations as in [[27-df-boolop]]; $\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-dual]]."},{"id":"1db381c4fa3bc53e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$(f_i)_{i\\in[m]}\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n^{[m]}$，$\\mathcal F=\\{f_i\\mid i\\in[m]\\}$；$\\mathrm{Sol}_n$ 见 [[27-df-booleqsys]]。有限逐点析取及空析取见 [[27-df-boolop]]。"},{"id":"4fa15b19c682f360","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\land$ (pointwise conjunction, see [[27-df-boolop]])"},{"id":"19d9ef12fec056aa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；标量与向量异或见 [[27-df-boolop]]，空异或为 0。"},{"id":"db96d7ccaab1ce99","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$a\\in\\mathrm{Sol}(f)$，其中 $\\mathrm{Sol}(f)=\\{x\\mid f(x)=0\\}$ 见 [[27-df-solution]]；标量运算见 [[27-df-boolop]]。"},{"id":"26d274e6eb4329f8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\bigvee$ 的有限布尔标量及空族语义见 [[27-df-boolop]]。"},{"id":"db52121d11e13a81","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817"]}